          "statement": "assemble_final_video wraps the narration attempt: on AdcrushError it finishes the cut without narration, burns the captions on the planner's estimated timings, and records narration.failed with the vendor's code in both the ledger event and the caller's result. Re-running video-assemble once the provider recovers adds the voice and regenerates no clips. The posture generalises: the expensive, irreversible artifacts are the generated clips, so a cheap optional layer failing must never invalidate them."
