        {
          "record": "181ef565-7066-4d58-81a9-800cdc52c916",
          "statement": "video.NO_TEXT_RULE is a single string used by the video prompt and by every final image prompt (compile.no_text_rule()), widened to name headlines, stat callouts and buttons alongside captions, subtitles, titles and watermarks. The image lane had never had it: a 'final lockup' beat came back as a finished static ad with a REAL COFFEE. MORE YOU. headline, stat callouts and a SHOP NOW button, none of it requested, at TEXT_BURNED_IN critical 0.97. A model that knows what ads look like volunteers the typography unless told the frame is not where it goes."
