          "statement": "New style papercraft.yaml, generalized from the client reference reel YouChews_Papercraft_Unbuild.mp4 (1080x1920, 24s). Describes the craft and the tabletop only, never a product or ingredient: every object sculpted from matte paper on a seamless warm-paper ground, straight-down or high three-quarter framing, soft even top light with gentle contact shadows, warm neutral palette, camera_rig tripod, its own caption_style, on_screen_text true. Any campaign can adopt it."
        }
