          "statement": "Contract for the video self-improvement lane: every generated sheet carries a unified printed slug (six-zone layout catalog, guide vs canon grammar, campaign-format canvas); video prompts become referential 15s EDLs (<=3.5k chars, hard 6k) addressing sheets by slug/@Image index; total duration must be a multiple of 15s and groups exactly 15s; a media_review engine judges clips/images with Anthropic vision and retries at most 3 times with additive recipes (intensity 1 soft, 2 hard, 3 may simplify the beat); an append-only JSON ledger feeds a new adcrush dashboard; adcrush stays the CLI boundary; approved canon sheets are never regenerated; no assemble/music in this lane."
        }
