    {
      "id": "design-confirmed-30-items",
      "alternatives": [
        {
          "record": "ea50dbdb-ef7f-4530-9514-faa64f5c1a42",
          "statement": "User confirmed all 30 design decisions via a structured one-by-one questionnaire covering workspace/vectors/canon/style/guide-vs-final/LLM-boundary/hash-lock/viewer/interface/publish/dependency/terminology; one refinement adopted (style catalog ships with real template artifacts per style and style can be inferred rather than always asked); remaining ambiguities resolved (UGC terminal clarified as a UGC-vertical typo; missing active-project pointer resolves to a hard error, not silent fallback)."
