      "id": "first-live-video-verdict",
      "alternatives": [
        {
          "record": "0ffda16f-bd54-414f-aff8-950ee3b90efb",
          "statement": "seedance-2-fast, 15s, 720p, 9 references, 372 credits. Judged on 16 extracted frames against 9 labelled references in one vision call: verdict fail, shot 2 passed, shots 1 and 3 failed. Shot 3 TEXT_GARBLED critical 0.9 quoting the pouch front as 'Hamdins Coffee', 'Vixng Geee', 'CNELBITJVKV', '30 CTEWS', '150g L.S.3 QST' against thirteen lines of canon copy the prompt quoted verbatim; plus CANON_DRIFT 0.6 on pouch layout, SHAPE_DRIFT 0.7 on the wrapped chew reading as a cube, TEXT_GARBLED 0.5 on the foil tiles, STYLE_BREAK 0.35, MOTION_IMPLAUSIBLE 0.3. The critical defect is traceable to video-plan's own warning in the same run: dropped C:youchews_pouch_30ct. After print_critical the pouch, wrapped chew and opened wrapper sheets are all attached and the ingredient set and seamless location are dropped instead. The loop was stopped rather than climbed: three more attempts at 3.72 dollars each could not fix a missing attachment, and the intensity-1 recipe hint was more of the same words that had already failed. One in-flight attempt was correctly ADOPTED rather than resubmitted when the plan changed, which is right behaviour that happened to be unhelpful here since its prompt carried the old references, so both attempts were set aside and the ladder restarted clean."
