          "record": "8b02136d-ad66-4319-b170-ce24dd7421e2",
          "statement": "A 2K GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst render costs 10 kie credits. A 15s seedance-2.5 720p clip costs roughly 1,000 -- two orders of magnitude more, and the single most important number when planning a run. kie charges a clip when it SUCCEEDS rather than when it is queued, so a credit reading taken while jobs are in flight understates committed spend; a budget guard must reserve for every queued job, not only for future submits. Harvesting an already-paid clip is free: video-loop --max-retries 0 polls the in-flight job, downloads, judges once and best-effort promotes without ever submitting."
